        !! Compute the complete elliptic integral of the first kind \( K(k) \) using AGM
        !! 
        !! @warning
        !! - The elliptic modulus \( k \) must satisfy \( |k| \le 1 \)
        !! - Returns `ieee_quiet_nan`    for \( |k| > 1 \)
        !! - Returns `ieee_positive_inf` for \( |k| = 1 \)
        !! @endwarning
